<html>
<title>Data View</title>
<body>


<h1>Data View</h1>

<p>
Two data views are possible, <strong>Dump</strong> or <strong>Single</strong>. The view can be switched using the <strong>Data view</strong> selector (1) shown below.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Dump view:</strong>
</p>

<p>
<img src="images/profiler_dump.png" border="0" width="724" height="609">
</p>
<ul>
<li>(1) <strong>Data view</strong> selector</li>
<li>(2) <strong>Profiler</strong> panel, showing <strong>Dump</strong> view</li>
</ul>

<p>
<strong>Single view:</strong>
</p>

<p>
<img src="images/profiler_single.png" border="0" width="724" height="609">
</p>

<p>
In <strong>Dump</strong> view, 4 bytes and 4 characters are shown per line; in <strong>Single</strong> view, 1 byte and 1 character are shown per line.
</p>
</body>
</html>
